<?php require_once __DIR__.'/includes/bootstrap.php';include __DIR__.'/includes/header.php'; ?><section class="page-banner"><span class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</span><h1>About Agribusiness</h1><p>A practical digital bridge between smallholder farmers and the people who need their harvest.</p></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Why Agribusiness?</h2><p>Smallholder farmers often depend on long supply chains and limited access to buyers. Agribusiness gives farmers a simple place to present available produce and helps households, hotels, schools and other buyers discover local supply.</p><h2>How it works</h2><ol><li>Farmers register and create produce listings.</li><li>An administrator reviews listings for publication.</li><li>Buyers search approved produce and add items to a cart.</li><li>Orders can be tracked from placed to delivered, with a printable receipt.</li></ol><p>Agribusiness is a student project prototype. Always verify produce quality, availability and delivery arrangements with the seller before making real-world commitments.</p></section><?php include __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php'; ?>